Dear Sir,

Pls. find enclosed here with Purchase Orders, Acknowledge the same & arrange
the material/services on door delivery as per requirement at the earliest to
our delivery address as mentioned in our attached PO Copy. to reach our site
before 04:00 P.M on any working day.

Pl. mention our Purchase order Number in all dispatch documents 

Once dispatch from your side please provides tracking details of the same
and send us scan copy of the invoice.

Make sure following documents should be submitted along with consignment at
our plant Dholka. Without or missing any of the following documents our
plant will not accept the material. 

Documents required with material: 

1)      Delivery Challan/ Invoice copy.

2)      All required test Certificate.

3)      Our Purchase Order copy.

Don't be send material via First Flight Courier & TCI Express Courier &
Tirupati Courier.

Thanks ,

           J.Joshi

 

Purchase Department

Concord Biotech Limited

Unit I : 1482-86,Trasad Road, 

Dholka ,Dist : Ahmedabad-382225

Gujrat,India.

Tel : 02714 -688666

 <mailto:purchase@concordbiotech.com> Email: engpurchase@concordbiotech.com 

 


